flowchart TD
    A[Directory Scanner] --> B[Markdown Parser]
    B --> C[Mermaid Extractor]
    C --> D[Syntax Validator]
    D --> E{Valid?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Skip Block]
    E -->|No| G[AI Fixer]
    G --> H[Re-validate]
    H --> I{Fixed?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Update Content]
    I -->|No| K[Log Error]
    F --> L[Next Block]
    J --> L
    K --> L
    L --> M{More Blocks?}
    M -->|Yes| D
    M -->|No| N[Save File]